Lean Proof Search is derived from the proof-generation and native Lean search
implementation in Mathematics-ai-atp.

Original project: https://github.com/iCog-Labs-Dev/Mathematics-ai-atp
Working fork: https://github.com/jajos12/Mathematics-ai-atp
Extraction source: 3d996a39cf0c7ea94d2dfecaac30d741e5c3e0f2

Original authors and contributors retain their respective copyrights.
The original GNU General Public License version 2 is included verbatim in LICENSE.

Extraction modifications: standalone Python packaging, import/module boundaries,
packaged Lean resource loading, package-wide implementation hashes, migration
documentation, and independent installation/regression checks. Search semantics,
model revision, benchmark selection, and proof-validation contracts are retained.

External model and benchmark assets have their own licenses and are not bundled.
